					"content": "-.  -...  -.  -...  ---",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401300503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「特爾克西」"
				},
				{
					"id": 401300503,
					"content": "大家…不要這麼沉重…祖莉亞夫人說過，要是我們也憂心忡忡，病人會被傳染的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401300504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401300504,
					"content": "說得對，我要笑一下！如果要把什麼傳染給祖莉亞夫人，那就是笑容！我們要帶著笑容完成這場歷險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401300505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401300505,
					"content": "然後祖莉亞夫人就會好起來，對不對？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401300506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401300506,
					"content": "一定會的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401300507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401300507,
					"content": "嗯，一定會的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				}
			]
		},
